[h2]Build 0.9.33[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Loaders with Return leftovers on now put leftovers back anywhere in a row of shelves (or linked storage), not only the shelf at the gripper.
[*]When a Loader leaves an item on the belt instead of putting it back, it now says why: which machine on the line still needs it, the storage does not accept it, or the storage is full.
[/list]
